Nova5 change to pkg-to-anyps5 v0.2.5 (https://github.com/awake-devel/pkg-to-anyps5, GPL-3.0-or-later), 2026-10-25.
Demon's Souls (PPSA01341) keeps about 1.25 GiB after the last listed file boundary, which the 1 GiB limit rejected as corrupt.
The shipped tools\pkg-to-anyps5.exe is v0.2.5 built with this change: cargo build --release

